Notice of the strategy gallery

The 617 strategy files in this folder that carry a licence header of their own are hand-written Rust versions of published trading scripts. Each is changed
from its original: rewritten in another language, against vike's own engine and indicators. No code generated from
an original was read or used. Each strategy file opens with its licence as an SPDX line, every copyright notice its
licence requires to be kept, the page or repository it comes from, and the line "Changed: rewritten by hand in Rust
for vike."

The other files in this folder are vike's own, under the workspace's licence (LICENSE.md at the repository root). The
reference trade lists, reference numbers and bars the strategies were checked against are not part of this folder.

